{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceAndAssign\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">synthInstanceAndAssign</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Helper function for instantiating a type class `type`, and\nthen using the result to perform `isDefEq x val`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceAndAssign","kind":"def","line":250,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceAndAssign","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L250-L256"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">synthInstance</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance","kind":"def","line":245,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L245-L248"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">synthInstance?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance?","kind":"def","line":240,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstance?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L240-L243"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.registerInstance\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">registerInstance</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type </span><span class=\"fn\">inst</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Registers `inst` as **the** instance for `type`. `synthInstance?` returns it without\nrunning typeclass resolution, making `inst` the canonical representative for `type`.\nIntended for satellite modules that construct instances for types they create themselves\n(e.g., `grind linarith`'s envelope type `IntModule.OfNatModule.Q`).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.registerInstance","kind":"def","line":231,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.registerInstance","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L231-L238"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceMeta?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">synthInstanceMeta?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceMeta?","kind":"def","line":219,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.synthInstanceMeta?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L219-L229"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getBuiltinInstance?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">getBuiltinInstance?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Some modules in grind use builtin instances defined directly in core (e.g., `lia`).\nUsers may provide nonstandard instances that are definitionally equal to the ones in core.\nGiven a type, such as `HAdd Int Int Int`, this function returns the instance defined in\ncore.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.getBuiltinInstance?","kind":"def","line":72,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.getBuiltinInstance?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/SynthInstance.lean#L72-L101"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Int.Package","Init.Grind.Ordered.Int","Init.Grind.Ordered.Ring","Init.Grind.Ring","Init.GrindInstances","Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM","Lean.Meta.SynthInstance"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.SynthInstance"}